3. Quantity Calculation

Listed Room Area:

168 + 132 + 110 + 80 + 35 + 35

= 560 sq.ft

Tile Wastage = 5%

Wastage Quantity = 560 × 5 / 100

= 28 sq.ft

Total Tile Quantity = 560 + 28

= 588 sq.ft

4. BOQ Formula

Amount = Quantity × Rate

Grand Total = Sum of All Item Amounts

